@startuml
title Strict compatibility：Deep Research 外层 work graph
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant "Host Agent" as Agent
participant "ResearchSpec CLI" as CLI
participant "deep-research\n13-agent team" as ARSU
database "Workspace" as Files

Agent -> CLI : status + route instructions
CLI --> Agent : one of 8 routes, prerequisites,
CLI --> Agent : artifact DAG, Gate, risk and cost
Agent -> User : route summary
User --> Agent : confirm exact route
Agent -> CLI : Start
CLI -> Files : receipt then subflow state

loop artifact work frontier
  Agent -> CLI : instructions work:<scoped-node>
  CLI --> Agent : declared input/output boundary
  Agent -> ARSU : invoke selected route for this artifact
  note over ARSU
    Semantic procedure as applicable:
    scoping -> investigation -> analysis
    -> composition -> review -> revision
    Systematic routes add risk-of-bias/meta-analysis;
    Socratic and monitoring roles are route-specific.
  end note
  ARSU -> Files : candidate artifact only
  Agent -> CLI : hash-bound Submit
  CLI -> Files : submit receipt + registry
end

opt required route Gate
  Agent -> CLI : gate instructions
  Agent -> User : Verify verdict and evidence
  User --> Agent : explicit confirmation
  Agent -> CLI : submit formal Gate
  CLI -> Files : Gate receipt + ledger
end
Agent -> CLI : Advance complete transition
CLI -> Files : transition receipt + state
@enduml
